      <title>吉利研发1800kW超快充设施 充电5分钟成可能</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260903/%E5%90%89%E5%88%A9%E7%A0%94%E5%8F%911800kW%E8%B6%85%E5%BF%AB%E5%85%85%E8%AE%BE%E6%96%BD-%E5%85%85%E7%94%B55%E5%88%86%E9%92%9F%E6%88%90%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD/</link>
